**Table 1: Resolution accuracy.**

| Dataset Type | Tree Accuracy | Precision | Recall | F1Score |
| ------------ | ------------: | --------: | -----: | ------: |
| Random       |        99.39% |    99.76% | 98.93% |  99.35% |
| Popular      |        99.50% |   100.00% | 99.17% |  99.58% |
| Mostdep      |        97.04% |    99.96% | 97.49% |  98.71% |
EOTABLE

# Section 2: Artifact download
